{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule event_parity(\n    input  clk,\n    input  rst_n,\n    input  din,\n    output q\n);\n\n    localparam S0 = 1'b0;\n    localparam S1 = 1'b1;\n\n    reg state;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin\n        if (!rst_n)\n            state <= S0;\n        else begin\n            case (state)\n                S0: begin\n                    if (din)\n                        state <= S1;\n                    else\n                        state <= S0;\n                end\n                S1: begin\n                    if (din)\n                        state <= S0;\n                    else\n                        state <= S1;\n                end\n                default: state <= S0;\n            endcase\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign q = state;\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
